---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-ink text-ink-foreground">
  <div class="shell grid gap-14 py-20 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:py-28">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
        <span class="font-display text-[1.4rem] tracking-[0.34em] flex items-center">
          CALVERIS<span class="ml-[4px] font-body text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] opacity-80">GLOBAL</span>
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block size-[6px] rotate-45 bg-accent"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm font-display text-2xl font-light italic text-ink-foreground/80">
        Your finance function.<br/>More capacity. Less complexity.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-foreground/55">
        Calveris Global provides dedicated accounting and finance professionals to businesses worldwide. Your control. Our people.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-2">
      <p class="eyebrow text-ink-foreground/45">Navigation</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#model" class="text-sm text-ink-foreground/75 transition-colors hover:text-accent">How we work</a></li>
        <li><a href="#roles" class="text-sm text-ink-foreground/75 transition-colors hover:text-accent">Services</a></li>
